<title>UK: 3M sets $250 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>3M sets $250 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MINNESOTA MINING AND MANUFACTURING</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    30.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.65     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
